    "chapterId": 15,
    "fileId": 51768,
    "type": "Figure",
    "diagnosis": "Classic microglandular adenosis ",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "The epithelium of microglandular adenosis does not express ER. In contrast, the epithelium of normal ducts and acini shows scattered and heterogeneous positivity of ER. (ER immunohistochemical stain)",
    "source": "Edi Brogi",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "",
