    "legend": "The epithelium of microglandular adenosis is characterized by strong expression of S100. In contrast, the epithelium of normal ducts and acini does not express S100; focal weak staining is noted in the myoepithelial layer of normal ducts and acini. (S100 immunohistochemical stain)",
