    "diagnosis": "<p>Microglandular adenosis</p>",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "<p>Core biopsies show microglanular adenosis with haphazardly placed, small open tubules with luminal pink colloid-like secretions.&nbsp; Focal atypical lobular hyperplasia and apocrine metaplasia are also present.</p>",
    "source": "Imported from 5th edition<br><br><p>SGH Pathology</p>",
    "copyright": "",
